{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30001_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e398adf12581c9f63fddc6e6f679290fad998927871bdc2b7c153d679ebb7172",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cec4d7e99dd1bfb933dae7aa190e15cad947290662d0b26b1c29006097a657",
      "text": "让笑容之花绽放",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc4c22b1a3ac93b23fc37702cc9b89cad9b8110c6d0e7ce3f9695fc23ddf702",
      "text": "受邀在朋友的结婚喜宴上\n担任友人代表致辞的实。\n作为祝贺，他与皮埃尔和恭二三人决定\n登台演唱《想いはETERNITY》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22cec4d7e99dd1bfb933dae7aa190e15cad947290662d0b26b1c29006097a657",
      "text": "让笑容之花绽放",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b468df955f12a4b9854940456b4ca69fb092e1faca73c57a3f4910ba8348bfe8",
      "text": "……当时，依然年幼懵懂的我们，\n除了彼此这些伙伴，根本没有能互相理解的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874a8ebb0fb18dfbe002a08e903797192a64bf3073ed57c41b7c726638b9c520",
      "text": "但是，正因为有了伙伴的陪伴，无论是快乐还是痛苦，\n我们都能拼尽全力跨越过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b67653c4f58154491414f1a2f15ade5dbc6526cb288f36576c6aa84fad5e9b5",
      "text": "我们明白，\n幸福是无法独自一人创造的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d03b641eb5f411b53a8c3a3cf35cb51d215e166954bcdda2aac3321b9804cfc5",
      "text": "今后也请两个人携手并进，\n一同创造幸福，分享幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14955ac7cd8d038595123653604f08ba2c6824bf1c8b9e424bd8db16b22586a2",
      "text": "祝愿二位拥有满溢着笑容的未来……\n这是我们送上的通行护照，请收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96ceb6b2d1fcbcdabe6c03fcf2f5a5866bde4f4f92f496740b23ea46d58dd14",
      "text": "辛苦了，实先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e6fb10e81b80d1263574091c75dd264de28c671707f16a4264bddcc40f29ce1",
      "text": "啊哈哈……因为是第一次在朋友面前做偶像，\n稍微有点紧张呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d10ec5296ac2b48597c8e47b7782250b3021c9ec1a19125caa2faa630f79aa6",
      "text": "我的心意，不知是否好好传达给那家伙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f57e0a547c7bebac357397dda1b1911453403f642854cc4bd094a4160873b7e",
      "text": "实先生的心意一定传达到了。\n是非常棒的致辞和舞台表演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90cd2f45086f4b6102f821584ca740d345204651f9ef5b2998c885a1b693c775",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー……\n今天能在这里表演，真的太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000009:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "几个月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a98944e16bb8b73ff70c6d89bceb507a26817980406de65f48503e7c441ee01",
      "text": "喂，你好。\n啊，是你啊。怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f422f336d58cb9a8b27d43498ccbb15d9d1cbc399623315de85eb97815307f4e",
      "text": "哟，好久不见。其实啊，我要结婚了。\n过阵子要办婚宴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:958a439cf93d5cd013e82c3a5da14748ce9f3da94225c7456450f5a375079f16",
      "text": "真的吗？恭喜你啊！\n这样啊，终于要结婚了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fc98811849c7e266b6a6c4a68550e70dacfff4449edec989b5c11150ecca01c",
      "text": "是啊，所以想请渡边你作为友人代表，\n在婚宴上致个辞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23b8a757d6335f533a933d9ab7495f00f99a20b56e26e3c741437fd1f5bbf24d",
      "text": "那当然没问题！无论放下什么我都会赶过去的。\n……啊，对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e8fd82149d72405172191021cc9550f16443edc1731a087582b14143182c23",
      "text": "要是不介意的话，作为祝贺，能不能让我们来\n表演一场呢？毕竟是重要朋友的新起点嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913236d59e9218f2b6b3e4b67382f2dadc47e7960258a00f3d12b3fc5a41ba19",
      "text": "那可太感激了。难得有这机会，叫上摄影师，\n把你们的表演拍下来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51b71e30fe746fbdaaf4836786ffe8bbd4e2571976fed2700748066041288ec1",
      "text": "当然，最重要的一定得是\n拍我天下第一可爱的新娘子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:634c437767a2b4d7a0d39dd5b6addf40b0dc45fb60322398384f784380cab30d",
      "text": "哈哈，你可真会顺杆爬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89c917932cc4e1f6d8ed795ea4017a433728507729d5ad080640648b6d7ead9d",
      "text": "那我跟制作人商量一下。\n回头再打给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a4ac9ac8dba1e6be7aa7de6d0d50742702a9d028062caf1780e846b04dc503f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n有点事想跟你商量一下，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c2e9689aae396f036d038da029f692095bf5e286fb9d425e7f7389a21895036",
      "text": "实先生。好的，请问是什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be112ee24d0038df5e1b077e911d50841e91bf7b9307c0055eeb7cadd5449512",
      "text": "其实我过阵子要参加老朋友的结婚喜宴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7576696ecc2f738b2a0da4c8f1bffa797c5c841425f34f343581d293cbe28e",
      "text": "作为祝贺，我想和Beit的大家一起\n登台表演一次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c6fa254e3132830049c5f8d5be75009dff6cc61db164f9e6cb36f4b34b66032",
      "text": "新郎也很热心，\n还同意了进行拍摄，你觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbada3d793b8c2375b0a4d3d6ff8371bd45e287a5ca42e81e889c5f41e47eac5",
      "text": "真是太棒了。请务必去办吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ae58b54970a2a62b72be6729438121b80644f3136009390195d8fa23c35e2a8",
      "text": "谢谢你！\n我会去跟皮埃尔和恭二说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0722f76bf67df588b21e6383ed8c5b04b2e84100a2756450acd48d537f3adcbe",
      "text": "在结婚喜宴上表演什么的，\n虽然让人有点紧张……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9250391480184d72c5b384df287aa3d807153399cabd6bdac9e0ab60f0182a00",
      "text": "不过，我会协助的。\n毕竟平时一直受实先生关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc92a5ff8a738b1a299e91f45f808e80c9b00f5de40003efb7ae8149500da0bc",
      "text": "我也想去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac1f9ca45efc7ea147a41873fb957674449920873b57072f5667b03f702c0dc",
      "text": "要给实的朋友送上满满的祝福！\n然后，让好多好多人都露出笑容吧～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4645244d29e9480ea2c2827a809a17a17c95d652212af0f3e03b16f43a8ee563",
      "text": "喜宴当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df6f3cea1618b3b72e0d361f29a483136c46c18f4c53ccbea2ef1acce6ce3c6f",
      "text": "原来喜宴是在这里办啊。\n相当宽敞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0eee5ddc1e1f79c9bc01aaa9c9c5d77869e7e175da2612dd6c778134c0d5630",
      "text": "好热闹！\n有好多客人呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8491ce737ed2e7c66f6477501cd99715495aa76b686be23aa65cd6f57aaa5bda",
      "text": "……感觉面相凶狠的人挺多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e6f6957efd1d20467ccc1d555ec16e2a331ee9beb4d553aa1e933801231d6f1",
      "text": "呵呵，确实呢。\n虽然大家长相挺吓人，但都是好人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b87a85159589e65d89b185bf26bb4edc0b8a82eef455881d76deea6930731cf",
      "text": "嗯！刚才我迷路的时候，\n他们给我指路了。大家都很温柔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a5607c5dc9af31d0b622d255e085efe3e2ce89527887fba5819be95be139e4b",
      "text": "啊，实先生，好久不见！\n听说您以偶像身份出道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a8d52d945f70db99e0d5ecfa001462809f3d0f256e47a3ce8ea45a20dcbee56",
      "text": "实先生做的事果然还是那么帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1b6eb516f3221937282c620e0d8b49d14de4e38e765047782a24dcaab986218",
      "text": "实先生不参加婚宴吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f39e19eb99f5b096959d2f71ec9e337fbb22c02921cc2f9f7b5c3304527e9288",
      "text": "嗯，我稍微有点……对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89a662a632fdf15c34f32ce2c2fcf6673e28b7b00583b779b2715e83c254e5b9",
      "text": "（……实先生很受人仰慕呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15270a453b50a39a9eb1d3afce83299902ac745cc684d1135c2a2efb41e1e6cf",
      "text": "（想必在这里，\n他也曾是大家值得依靠的同伴吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa47f85dd048fcbb089f4dedec08cf7b012c0bed6710dbe2f61845aee03e979",
      "text": "让你们久等了！那我们去休息室吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6277f9315fa3fe2c7a739d867b641c3ded4f1100cdd4a064bab1fc900889c129",
      "text": "哟，感谢你们今天能来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fc0bce1ffc78bc2e72358f843717bd82ca8c8353cd44a65aea69773d36a0d40",
      "text": "新婚快乐！\n该说谢谢的是我们，收到邀请真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dcbadab7b1fc542e1500509c6732ae1bfbeb41ecea9af2555586c36f36aa110",
      "text": "不过，你居然也穿起无尾礼服了啊。\n真是佛要金装人要衣装呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47f91c8f35ae7c9437ca5a6a56c24e11f4bdab5faa719e2548001001334c2d1c",
      "text": "啰嗦，你不也一样嘛。\n穿得一身闪闪发光的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f2f3cc39a90f93638ffedd4c3aade5909f60db0ee37b18cb15c1fd245d83fb",
      "text": "值此佳期，祝二位新婚快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e310da3dc7b2bfaca63869ee2953704960114b108656bbe191fc06567035e4",
      "text": "恭喜二位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ff879b5d3970c6e9fb7a43bf814bf37933619741b0c819c5343bad315778fa7",
      "text": "你们就是渡边结识的新伙伴吗……\n这家伙承蒙各位多方照顾了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d4fc3d4c0aeff66b8806a353f48e2f7ca22ec90e75cc2f5162fdf748c84e0e",
      "text": "啊哈哈。干嘛露出那副感慨万千的表情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7387058b4b59c897c0b72898075c0e8c02ca56d4395a749b5303adb1a7f7d782",
      "text": "初次见面，实的朋友！\n我也是实的朋友，皮埃尔！还有这位是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c28271d9062a887b3724274ce4ef7007e42e296556c032e38416c5137621cc4a",
      "text": "我是鹰城恭二。\n那个……今天我们会全力献上祝福的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adf04c54cfa07ccc8e2b32765996fb2befa2a3a17fcf00e866d3862d3b9795ca",
      "text": "啊，多谢啦！\n渡边，致辞和唱歌我都满心期待着呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cfde044789e1ebc17248c321b2cf534bcad0d3adbf08ddfe95074f98583226",
      "text": "接下来，请在场来宾致辞。\n有请新郎的友人代表渡边先生，请大家鼓掌欢迎！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87245473d07f1c6a1f96927cd154812ca77561472c195402ce4a676f7c381b17",
      "text": "我是新郎的朋友渡边实。首先，\n新郎新娘两位，祝你们新婚快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3e27c243c313bda62378d03c84884a12d72102ed2e981316e00eebf36738af1",
      "text": "我和新郎是从十几岁时就认识的旧友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7bef9e2ed037f3cccb1d61333eb10fcd8afb8ddb6be4ea595785cb88dca5c2d",
      "text": "当时，依然年幼懵懂的我们，\n除了彼此这些伙伴，根本没有能互相理解的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874a8ebb0fb18dfbe002a08e903797192a64bf3073ed57c41b7c726638b9c520",
      "text": "但是，正因为有了伙伴的陪伴，无论是快乐还是痛苦，\n我们都能拼尽全力跨越过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b872db6703184373fb0bf3061ce3659985823d6ccfe97472c4bf9291a4789fa2",
      "text": "后来，新郎遇到了想要相伴一生的人，\n组建了家庭……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d5e8f0f9da4f63fa88c8f5d05c97b2b1dcb7c9ffa1ed839c7040f64e42efd6",
      "text": "而我也成为了一名偶像，邂逅了Beit这群\n如同家人一般重要的存在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4df2293748b715f672f019f168cf9061b5ac7d7313ea2a0c84c732578b2ff78",
      "text": "如今的我们之所以存在，\n正是因为那段无可替代的过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b67653c4f58154491414f1a2f15ade5dbc6526cb288f36576c6aa84fad5e9b5",
      "text": "我们明白，\n幸福是无法独自一人创造的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d03b641eb5f411b53a8c3a3cf35cb51d215e166954bcdda2aac3321b9804cfc5",
      "text": "今后也请两个人携手并进，\n一同创造幸福，分享幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14955ac7cd8d038595123653604f08ba2c6824bf1c8b9e424bd8db16b22586a2",
      "text": "祝愿二位拥有满溢着笑容的未来……\n这是我们送上的通行护照，请收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5b9a2e5830064a27588c27c7626f53c07621d19841d9209761a66ebee5545a",
      "text": "我们谨向二位送上最诚挚的应援。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2de953284d458ef884937d2fedf46af124d23e4450fae807429d070cf1edd1",
      "text": "呀呼——！把歌声和笑容传递给大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a859814ecd674472d950765c76bc15846e11927d2f25b00218c8c61e84029141",
      "text": "请听这首——《想いはETERNITY》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000069:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbfb50f613c56d6d0336076995230c7035e54f363b9aacbef7928deaf024db67",
      "text": "表演结束……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7119c27625984ef68d8c1d1ea61cb39e869becd3890d211ff9c78a1a14db831e",
      "text": "感谢大家的聆听！\n愿大家的笑容之花，从今往后也能……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f96435f64638e53cbb134fb089e70907d0db976608ea8b436d8981713f918b4",
      "text": "实，你哭了！\n怎么了，不要紧吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aaef6352f232606ffa9b2a0998997f0aa31dc0c9fe50b3835cc7baee5e74585",
      "text": "皮埃尔……\n谢谢你，我没事哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d389fde18c1ae4cf25fc599289a726da0c23fd3e238c1900a2082ebea05af6c",
      "text": "……二位，真的恭喜了。这个请收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d799dbc5072b960190a91028f39510d7f2b8c0dc96af91e8db888767dc6ed1e",
      "text": "好美丽的花束……还有，那么精彩的歌声……\n谢谢、你们……呜呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7924d5e215d987d667d9937e05d1d11bb0c4e6d5c24981375017746ed448d203",
      "text": "……啊，你们的心意，我切实收到了。\n谢啦，渡边。你真是我最好的哥们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da2ca485ab89a36a307fbc65ae2c69b5f569adbd1044cf39ccc02a088e110f49",
      "text": "我也是……作为朋友，\n能在你们的喜庆之日锦上添花，真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000135:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecefb1e6ac03061c9926c276102ddbe8d03c21fed6699b27b6f1565c5b16e034",
      "text": "啊，喂喂！\n制作人，我是皮埃尔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b37877dc494e990518f0c0370bc6843e48b9bee90f4089fa6a34a6e9c2dc7bf2",
      "text": "喜宴，太好了呢！\n真的非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000147:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39f57c6c3aeda7cc875322a85b85e6b126acdb9596fa9cf2d5da5a88b5a4f0f3",
      "text": "实，哭了。\n我也，差点就，哭出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15042bd8b40a5df88da99b60c12aa2cb3f6afe464176fc519a9845177bdd4f8",
      "text": "我们的祝福心情，\n传达给他们两个人了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cb223181dc61910b8b3045c3b1ccb984ffb5719e859650e2fcca06f5e931548",
      "text": "一定传达到了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94be1894304e786dd1a26c0e2e27d7c3dbaa9925d217575acea7de64b7bdad21",
      "text": "嗯！要是这样就太高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd891f5f5eb88704a2c85cc353397f56bc9e42b4b80d8c38ab0c3d4d96757f30",
      "text": "喜宴要是每天都有就好了。\n那样就会一直很幸福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_g:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f23a226ff1d3d2e04651c688951bf229d9ec3f242aeafb68538f6c5cf72e70",
      "text": "那么，明天见啦，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239cfc2f58f7e2187d43d638091c60163372d80e3ed48d2862e6fb3ee4328a12",
      "text": "那么，今天的焦点话题是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dbb97375648672e27c3346fbc81a3c708aa48fef92497eb9769a758ba30ebeb",
      "text": "话题偶像组合Beit在结婚喜宴上的表演视频。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cb3de4f913193f94361574273595bae3ce1114d590c34601602a11cf11596af",
      "text": "目前视频播放量已突破三十万次，观众纷纷留言表示\n“太感动了”“跟着哭了出来”，好评如潮。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf580f82c69076b632045ac88dd373052e9a4777c156d67506bd337ec0314c7e",
      "text": "本次我们采访到了Beit的成员、\n同时也是新郎好友的渡边实先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a3f809cfcb2a6ff50828f7772100a29cba79b893a5a6859257216fc119c7bfb",
      "text": "这是送给重要朋友的新起点礼物。\n想要将我们力所能及的最棒应援传递给他……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f948a7a7a629b1e6eb49db550de098080273695263b6a7a55c094fd1f6df14e0",
      "text": "如果能成为通往二人幸福未来的护照，\n那就再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:929944a4d348e9eed3a8baaa597d64962976c833144230844b0bcd1e280c9470",
      "text": "实，好帅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e826fb1ecd306304a5fb2bdbf0f5126b7fff42de1ce375c743959b7b552d03c",
      "text": "明明只是很简短的舞台表演，\n居然引起了这么大的反响啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04ba18d95ca488741cda6fa3e9bd2016f2872f605490dd25bbe4a5fabd5d625d",
      "text": "很让人惊讶吧。不过既送上了祝福，\n也为提高Beit的知名度做了贡献呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8673d9697eeecead4c7eb024dcdb1020c49d3113e7a091e0451fad30038ecb3b",
      "text": "这也多亏了你们两人的协助。\n真的很感谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3dbbdff20710c2b38802cf5806507e84570625f01d26671c6cedb74cb7c6b46",
      "text": "各位，出大事了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6664f8c02b8a7d9b3290d281771e90bf1bed475fe2d2c5aa9aec782bd65d1f08",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー？\n怎么了，这么慌慌张张的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02edd3612f607c01470e8c2daaaf802aa6698560361395be4103d4441bfb90f8",
      "text": "有婚庆公司发来邀约，希望能将《想いはETERNITY》\n起用为广告曲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a321f2e2b11a0b0069d6c1fc5089a613ffdf9d6de77764aa1b77bf3a9b537451",
      "text": "广、告……\n我们的歌要在电视上播出了？好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b257b24ea6aa34f37d7cc15e34bbc350b5f5200a7575bc7d04176a57f1bd04e7",
      "text": "而且，对方的委托不仅限于广告。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73f30501363cb8e18c3b373169b6b14e15bdcf43d10f4c138f54ce32d579501a",
      "text": "只要下载婚庆公司的官方应用，\n就能通过AR看到“新郎装扮的Beit”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9840b3fb03f80788a98729db5ed87be8a541fb364971b48d250c63a557c6df2a",
      "text": "“与身着新郎装扮的Beit并肩合影吧！\nDream Collaboration Campaign！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0fff60af49f37cde6d662efc2bb4b1ed66caeace7753913d6a43b8f4639636c",
      "text": "对方希望能合作开展这样的企划，特此前来商谈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:675f5e64eaf0a2aab127d49339cca7553aa55a7525edcc87a47c9896ec055634",
      "text": "……？诶、阿鲁？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5352fc3c7272ca1ea0a11cf2c29728f647dcd017a5c08597551e9fb57912c34a",
      "text": "就是用智能手机一扫，画面里就会显示出\n角色或图案的那种技术。呃……看，就像这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8436cf251b367d97b158c445e3eb7d394bb62290476820fccb14589b494be2",
      "text": "哦——！我们会在手机里跑出来？\n梦幻活动，好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c59305970c867b0d4bafbef54907a8350873461da08f10a358955f77145442",
      "text": "啊。……不，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c501d06534c3c37f64823831a6b02534dddc9e380edf67869bb3cd3a20074f38",
      "text": "我以AR形式出现，总觉得好难为情啊……\n而且，还是新郎装扮……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d78995a8b093863ce1ce63a0da295b095e988c5ff5f632ef525b074207944d5",
      "text": "有什么关系，看起来挺好玩的嘛！\n凡事贵在体验，对吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000120:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000127:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:690ddf2ac5e4fe87380cca3af7f420d4fe070ee1e9327762c73e27cc08a9bdc6",
      "text": "今天的拍摄，好紧张啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000129:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ca7ddbceedc87ffa6f15f03641c75857cd845d3008b06b10482ecc14cc6cf7d",
      "text": "好久没穿那么正规的衣服，\n憋得我都快喘不上气了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000131:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e36e37f61b524b61a3f84fa35944295901b35526c25072f8ec34bc70b66ce87",
      "text": "哈哈，毕竟新郎礼服平时\n没什么机会穿嘛<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000133:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b019406bc2a7e275fbe773a4c5056aa6a1520790a057ceb9e5616f9b9129cc",
      "text": "可是，大家都很合身！\n好想快点跟大家一起拍AR照<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000135:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4a58a3373dbc21ee598dbbab4394145c9c48168a87cde09ee812c621d470f87",
      "text": "是啊。\n真期待成品的模样呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000137:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1dc240d1c7b938f871e287dfd7cc39d6495d102db2340db79a96c7e48805ae0",
      "text": "三位都\n非常合适哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53838e6165531e709b091b096e65a8fafd7e4993b050f773e2d4a2c7d130e0a7",
      "text": "真的吗？听你这么说\n真让人开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7823a1913c48adb29deade17384b624cdd28d28de96bcc25bdbdb72c18c1ca",
      "text": "看来这番努力没白费啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_i:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c90d8099c8e553bb46fcf39afba4d6fd1362da756f8b2b96c7afc54ca093a39",
      "text": "制作人也辛苦了！<emoji>image_talk_emoji_40</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000017:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee78f529ea01a388cb6771859e27dedacb4faf854bada9128537ba0eccc6514",
      "text": "这就是实装好的AR功能。\n像这样用手机照过去……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce848fd9fe21dbbf419b7aaacfbb49f2f481f05f43a8b9dd36e164fa63672541",
      "text": "哇啊……有两个实！\n两个都好帅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d34ad214e2ff94c50cee7e6addc950f2ccf0061318119eaff9cd0c99f59bb274",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n你看，也能看到你们两个人的AR哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09522a285e7f73ebc21af3bafc1c86c54217d1b141116b3d7273bc2f7d13189f",
      "text": "真的耶，我和恭二也变成两个了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dc02c09cae91765591ed819309aaaa16902ec17df50f19053f9014b23339882",
      "text": "哦——……AR技术真厉害啊。\n眼前真的出现了一个我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64ee7324802edeac39f724f8ba3cf4a2179b7a457c49c6fe15ce653187ce8051",
      "text": "广告的反响非常好，而且在AR的带动下，\n应用的下载量也在稳步上升呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60322cf6ab59ef1d2bc01461a5aa82d0d1ef684d76c39a2950b54b0b9f7ece9a",
      "text": "想必有许多粉丝都在和各位合影吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:583409461245f511cff7eb3e94a37e50e4e52a897d82b2d2e919ca2b316553f2",
      "text": "就算相隔很远，也能一起拍照片。\n好厉害，好高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb21d607fce3ce88434263d4b93f9edfae86e501fadd3e74acd8299018875329",
      "text": "我以前也经常像这样，和喜欢的偶像海报\n或者立牌合影呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7269371d401c4eca49e734cb474a2c58b3342d348c00b3927b9feb577415f0b",
      "text": "没想到如今的自己竟然能接下这样的工作。\n……啊。对了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003ec6157f76869dea2f150ad108bbbdc9e8093cf2005e4a8a7b03a7cbc69362",
      "text": "我想把和AR并肩拍的照片发给那家伙。\n能麻烦你帮我拍一张吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcabd38bc8bbbd428f3d984c35e80772617cbb4fde85254fbe95e164bc1ab0fc",
      "text": "是给新郎先生的呢。那么，\n请站在那边……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aabfab7b9dbe11b7f17044d95f1cb35af5b5ba4003917125ecbab02dc0c2e09a",
      "text": "好，拍好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff402735b76f881ae323df749ce62217dc264cb2470ede10cee4e34adb6dc9d5",
      "text": "我也想一起拍！\n啊……对了，三个人一起拍吧！恭二也来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:878bdb4ba3744e8d85d2c70e71cc6b18e13fa8282e76a042c2eaa72755d6e11e",
      "text": "那么我要拍了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:970d085733eb5b001a6315745865ab27679325b69ca6db11ab312c878754080b",
      "text": "……好，拍好了！\n三个人，不对，六个人都拍得非常完美哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38a94f8254db13f48293eb467220ef725d564d9002ba8fcf7cb42fe4b2b9f95f",
      "text": "和自己合影这种事……\n感觉有点不可思议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee972b3c0b0d0ad1105eea73a63775a44b1c196406c90e74252bd53f2cdf3252",
      "text": "呵呵，好有趣！\n有两个实，两个恭二，还有两个我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff26664c52112fece9ee848c4da945a744238f33ec0748a76ea5e55aef889d5",
      "text": "对了！\n●●●●プロデューサー，也一起来拍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:571653289778d4d4c68f6496f1e4f8399abadbe87e32d9303de36c03b453440f",
      "text": "这主意不错。\n贤君，能麻烦你帮我们按一下快门吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbefc3861850ecc6c15c4c114844b7947687a0222a0a6a44bffe6ad809da040d",
      "text": "拍好了吗？给我看看给我看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f334753835ec73ccdbe0ed6eabed9465e04cd84b233f4dc9a9de631bc9a61119",
      "text": "果然还是有点害羞啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_k:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25867689ce08d74842a30fbc6157121b9f6b78e60b798eb98c89474bc6cf4a7",
      "text": "呵呵。不过，拍得非常漂亮哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
